  "english": [
    "The Gemara answers: <b>Come</b> and <b>hear</b> a resolution of this dilemma <b>from the dispute between Rabbi Meir and Rabbi Yosei, as we learned</b> in a mishna (<i>Temura</i> 25b): If one said about an animal: <b>This is hereby a substitute for a burnt-offering, a substitute for a peace-offering,</b> the <i>halakha</i> is that <b>it becomes a substitute</b> only <b>for a burnt-offering;</b> this is <b>the statement of Rabbi Meir,</b> who holds that one’s initial statement is determinant. <b>And Rabbi Yosei says: If this is what he intended from the outset,</b> that it should be a substitute for both a burnt-offering and a peace-offering, then <b>since it is impossible to give it two names at once</b> and he could not have said burnt-offering and peace-offering simultaneously, <b>his statement is effective,</b> and the animal is a substitute for both of them at once. Similarly, it is possible for him to intend to both ratify and nullify the vow and the vow is nullified, despite the fact that his first statement was to ratify it.",
    "The Gemara adds: <b>And even Rabbi Meir says</b> that the first part of one’s statement is determinant only <b>where he did not state: This will not take effect unless this</b> also <b>takes effect. Here, however, where he</b> expressly <b>said: The ratification</b> of the vow <b>will not take effect unless the nullification takes effect, even Rabbi Meir concedes that the nullification takes effect.</b>",
    "<b>Rabba</b> further <b>asks:</b> If he said: <b>It is ratified and nullified for you simultaneously, what is</b> the <i>halakha</i>? The Gemara answers: <b>Come</b> and <b>hear</b> that <b>which Rabba</b> himself <b>said: Any</b> two halakhic statuses <b>that</b> one <b>is not</b> able to implement <b>sequentially are not</b> realized <b>even</b> when one attempts to bring them about <b>simultaneously.</b> Since one cannot ratify a vow and subsequently nullify it, one can also not ratify and nullify a vow simultaneously.",
    "<b>Rabba raises</b> another <b>dilemma:</b> If one says to his wife or daughter: Your vow <b>is ratified for you today, what is</b> the <i>halakha</i>? <b>Do we say</b> that he is <b>like one who said to her: It is nullified for you tomorrow? Or perhaps,</b> since <b>he did not</b> explicitly <b>say to her</b> that the vow is nullified, it remains in force."
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>תָּא שְׁמַע מִפְּלוּגְתָּא <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Meir, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2068\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Meir\" data-name-he=\"רבי מאיר\">דְּרַבִּי מֵאִיר</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yosei, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1657\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yosei\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוסי בן חלפתא\">וְרַבִּי יוֹסֵי</span>.",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דִּתְנַן: ״הֲרֵי זוֹ תְּמוּרַת עוֹלָה תְּמוּרַת שְׁלָמִים״ —",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הֲרֵי זוֹ תְּמוּרַת עוֹלָה, דִּבְרֵי <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Meir, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2068\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Meir\" data-name-he=\"רבי מאיר\">רַבִּי מֵאִיר</span>. <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yosei, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1657\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yosei\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוסי בן חלפתא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-53614\">וְרַבִּי</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yosei, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1657\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yosei\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוסי בן חלפתא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-53614\">יוֹסֵי</span> אוֹמֵר: אִם לְכָךְ נִתְכַּוֵּין מִתְּחִלָּה, הוֹאִיל",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וְאִי אֶפְשָׁר לִקְרוֹת שְׁנֵי שֵׁמוֹת כְּאֶחָד — דְּבָרָיו",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "קַיָּימִין. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וַאֲפִילּוּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Meir, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2068\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Meir\" data-name-he=\"רבי מאיר\">רַבִּי מֵאִיר</span> לָא קָאָמַר, דְּלָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אָמַר ״לָא תֵּיחוּל זוֹ אֶלָּא אִם כֵּן חָלָה זוֹ״, אֲבָל",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הָכָא דְּאָמַר ״לֹא תֵּיחוּל הֲקָמָה אֶלָּא אִם כֵּן",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "חָלָה הֲפָרָה״ — <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Meir, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2068\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Meir\" data-name-he=\"רבי מאיר\">רַבִּי מֵאִיר</span> נָמֵי מוֹדֶה דַּהֲפָרָה חָלָה. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>בָּעֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2581\" data-full-name=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani\" data-name-he=\"רַבָּה בַּר נַחְמָנִי\">רַבָּה</span>: ״קַיָּים וּמוּפָר לִיכִי״ בְּבַת אַחַת, מַהוּ? תָּא שְׁמַע",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דְּאָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2581\" data-full-name=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani\" data-name-he=\"רַבָּה בַּר נַחְמָנִי\">רַבָּה</span>: כׇּל דָּבָר שֶׁאֵינוֹ בְּזֶה אַחַר זֶה,",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֲפִילּוּ בְּבַת אַחַת אֵינוֹ. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>בָּעֵי <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2581\" data-full-name=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani\" data-name-he=\"רַבָּה בַּר נַחְמָנִי\">רַבָּה</span>: ״קַיָּים לִיכִי הַיּוֹם״,",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מַהוּ? מִי אָמְרִינַן: כְּמַאן דַּאֲמַר לַהּ ״מוּפָר",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לִיכִי לְמָחָר״, אוֹ דִלְמָא הָא לָא אֲמַר לַהּ?",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rashi": [
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "<b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">ת&quot;ש</span></b> דכי האי גוונא פלוגתא דר\"מ ורבנן במסכת תמורה בפ' כיצד",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "מערימין על הבכור: <b>״הֲרֵי <span class=\"dh-divergent\">זה</span> תְּמוּרַת עוֹלָה תְּמוּרַת שְׁלָמִים״ <span class=\"dh-divergent\">כו&#x27;</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">דבריו</span></b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "<b>קַיָּימִין</b> ויביא בדמי חציה עולה ובדמי חציה שלמים: <b>ואפילו</b> <b>רבי</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "<b>מֵאִיר.</b> לא אמר תפוס לשון ראשון אלא דלא אמר לא תיחול זו אלא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "אם כן חלה שניה ועל מה נחלקו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "באומר תמורת עולה ותמורת",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "שלמים רבי מאיר סבר דלמא מיהדר",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "הוא דהדר ביה מתמורת עולה ואמר",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "תמורת שלמים והואיל וכן תפוס",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "תחלת דבריו והרי היא עולה: ור' יוסי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "סבר אי אמר תמורת עולה ושלמים",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "הוה אמינא קדושה ואינה קריבה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "קמ\"ל: <b>אֲבָל הָכָא <span class=\"dh-divergent\">דקאמר</span> ״לֹא <span class=\"dh-divergent\">תחול</span></b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "<b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">בו&amp;#x27</span></b> ודאי הויא הפרה כי ההוא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "טעמא דתמורה: <b>״קַיָּים וּמוּפָר לִיכִי״.</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "ולא אמר ליכי בין קיים למופר מי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "אמרינן כיון דלא אמר קיים ליכי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "ומופר לכי הויא כמ\"ד לא תיחול",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "הקמה אלא אם כן חלה הפרה דכיון",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "דלא אמר קיים ליכי גלי אדעתיה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "דבהפרה ניחא ליה או דלמא לא שנא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "וכמ\"ד קיים ליכי ומופר ליכי דמי ולא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "תהוי הפרה: <b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">ת&quot;ש</span> דְּאָמַר רַבָּה</b> [בקדושין] ואמעשר בהמה קאי: <b>כל</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "<b>שֶׁאֵינוֹ בְּזֶה אַחַר זֶה.</b> כגון שאם קרא לעשירי עשירי וחזר וקרא לי\"א",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "עשירי אינו קדוש וקאמר אף בבת אחת שאם קרא לשניהן עשירי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "סתם אין האחד עשר קדוש ה\"נ כיון דאינו בזה אחר זה שאם אמר לה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "עכשיו קיים ליכי ולאחר שעה אמר מופר ליכי אין בהפרתו כלום בבת",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "אחת נמי כי אמר קיים ומופר ליכי אין באותה הפרה כלום אע\"ג",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:3:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "דבבת אחת קאמר קיים ומופר ליכי: <b>הַיּוֹם״, מַהוּ.</b> מי אמרינן כיון",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "דאמר היום כמאן דאמר היום יהא מקויים אבל למחר יהא מופר לה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "והוי מופר: <b>אוֹ דִלְמָא הָא לָא אֲמַר לַהּ.</b> בפירוש מופר ליכי למחר:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Nedarim 69b:4:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    }
  ],
